[node name="RichTextLabel2" parent="Camera/Email" index="7" unique_id=24024372 instance=ExtResource("3_afait")]
text = "Hello Jeremy,

I just heard you've spent a lot of time on something called the \"Enhanced Prototype Window.\"    [img  width=64 height=16]res://assets//images/small_fenetrein.png[/img]

If I understand correctly, this \"window\" is made of a special kind of glass that lets light pass through it, so lasers from the [i]prototype[/i] can pass through this glass. 

Like... any other kind of glass, actually.

So it seems you've developed and installed VERY expensive, completely ordinary windows everywhere.

I expect you to justify these unplanned expenses in a timely manner.

Julia Lion
Coordinating Chief Data Manager"

